            "integration_sources": [],
            "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Fusing four adjacent DP rows into a column sweep keeps intermediate values in registers and reduces DP-array loads and stores by fourfold, potentially improving throughput over separate rolling-row sweeps.",
